sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant MainUI as Main window UI
    participant ActivityUI as Activity window UI
    participant Shared as Shared Tag Rules
    participant Gateway as Window-local IPC Gateway
    participant Cmd as Rust TagIpcCommands
    participant Service as TagCatalogService
    participant Repo as TagRepository
    participant DB as Business SQLite + independent Activity SQLite/KV
    participant Events as Host Tag Event
    participant AI as AiClient/Parser

    Note over Cmd,DB: Startup and migration
    Cmd->>Service: initialize / recoverPendingMutations()
    Service->>Repo: apply schema migrations and idempotent backfill
    Repo->>DB: ensure items.tags; seed empty tags from valid legacy categoryKey once
    Repo->>DB: commit migration marker with data changes
    Service->>Repo: load settings KV + item tag paths
    Repo-->>Service: catalog rows and assignments
    Service->>Shared: build canonical catalog inputs
    Shared-->>Service: normalized sorted tree
    par Both windows initialize
      MainUI->>Gateway: tag_catalog_list()
      Gateway->>Cmd: IPC list
      Cmd->>Service: list()
      Service-->>MainUI: TagNode[]
    and
      ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_catalog_list()
      Gateway->>Cmd: IPC list
      Cmd->>Service: list()
      Service-->>ActivityUI: TagNode[]
    end
    MainUI->>Events: subscribe tags:changed
    ActivityUI->>Events: subscribe tags:changed

    Note over User,Events: Manual assignment from data/history or item editor
    User->>ActivityUI: select tags for app/item row
    ActivityUI->>Shared: normalize and validate for immediate feedback
    Shared-->>ActivityUI: canonical assignment or validation error
    ActivityUI->>ActivityUI: optimistic chip update
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_assignment_set(assignment)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC set
    Cmd->>Service: setAssignment(input)
    Service->>Shared: normalize and validate again
    Service->>Repo: begin transaction / prepare journal
    Repo->>DB: ensure path registration + update object tags/primary
    Repo->>DB: commit object and catalog changes
    Service->>Events: emit tags:changed(revision, affected targets)
    Service-->>Cmd: canonical TagAssignment
    Cmd-->>Gateway: success DTO
    Gateway-->>ActivityUI: canonical assignment
    Events-->>MainUI: tags:changed
    MainUI->>Gateway: reload affected assignments/catalog
    Gateway-->>MainUI: refreshed chips
    Note over ActivityUI: On IPC failure, rollback optimistic state and show localized error

    Note over User,Events: Rename with conflict preview
    User->>ActivityUI: request rename path to destination
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_mutation_preview(rename, source, destination)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC preview
    Cmd->>Service: preview()
    Service->>Repo: read descendant paths and all references
    Repo-->>Service: impacted apps, sites, items and counts
    Service-->>ActivityUI: TagMutationPreview + app_category conflicts + expectedFingerprint
    ActivityUI-->>User: show impact and app_category conflict details; resolve conflicts before retry
    alt conflicts not empty
      ActivityUI-->>User: reject entire operation; resolve conflicts first
    else no conflicts
      User->>ActivityUI: confirm
    end
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_rename(source, destination, expectedFingerprint)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC mutate
    Cmd->>Service: rename()
    Service->>Repo: re-read impact, validate fingerprint/conflicts, then prepare journal
    Repo->>DB: insert prepared journal in business SQLite
    Repo->>DB: activity SQLite transaction: rewrite app_category and override references
    Repo->>DB: business SQLite transaction: rewrite items.category_key to target/NULL and update items.tags
    Repo->>DB: update journal phase after each single-DB commit
    Note over Repo,DB: focus_blocks.category_key is not written here; projector rebuilds the activity snapshot from business data
    Service->>Events: emit tags:changed only after all journal phases complete
    Service-->>ActivityUI: updated catalog
    Events-->>MainUI: refresh active catalog and chips

    Note over User,Events: Delete and restore
    User->>ActivityUI: request delete path
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: preview(delete, path)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC preview
    Cmd->>Service: preview()
    Service->>Repo: collect subtree and impacted objects
    Repo-->>ActivityUI: counts, first N names, conflicts, expectedFingerprint
    ActivityUI-->>User: confirm cascade delete
    User->>ActivityUI: confirm delete
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_delete(path, cascade, confirmed)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC delete
    Cmd->>Service: delete()
    Service->>Repo: revalidate impact and persist
    Repo->>DB: business SQLite: map items.category_key to target/NULL and remove tag refs
    Repo->>DB: activity SQLite: remove refs; promote next app tag; tombstone built-in definitions
    Note over Repo,DB: focus_blocks is a rebuildable projection, never a second propagation source
    Repo->>DB: commit each single-DB phase or leave recoverable journal; no cross-DB atomic transaction
    Service->>Events: emit tags:changed
    User->>ActivityUI: restore built-in tombstone
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_restore(path)
    Gateway->>Cmd: IPC restore
    Cmd->>Service: restore(path)
    Service->>Repo: clear tombstone without inventing references
    Service->>Events: emit tags:changed

    Note over User,AI: AI suggestions are previews; confirmation writes through normal assignment
    User->>ActivityUI: request suggestions for selected targets
    ActivityUI->>Gateway: ai_suggest_tags(requestId, targets, candidates)
    Gateway->>AI: check config/entry switch; request with total budget
    AI->>AI: retry transient failures with bounded backoff
    AI->>AI: extract JSON and validate rows against existing candidates
    AI-->>Gateway: suggestions + parse/retry/batch stats
    Gateway-->>ActivityUI: preview suggestions
    ActivityUI-->>User: show selectable rows and dropped count
    alt User cancels or window closes
      ActivityUI->>Gateway: ai_cancel(requestId)
      Gateway->>AI: cancel transport and discard late response
      AI-->>ActivityUI: AI_CANCELLED; no writes
    else User confirms selected suggestions
      User->>ActivityUI: apply selected rows
      loop Each selected target
        ActivityUI->>Gateway: tag_assignment_set(canonical assignment)
        Gateway->>Cmd: IPC set
        Cmd->>Service: setAssignment()
        Service->>Repo: persist through shared tag path
      end
      Service->>Events: emit tags:changed after successful writes
      Events-->>MainUI: reload affected tags
    end
